@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

' Domain styling with frames
skinparam frame {
  BackgroundColor #E1BEE7
  BorderColor #9370DB
  BorderThickness 2
  FontColor black
  FontSize 11
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor #FFE4B5
  BorderColor #666666
  FontSize 10
}

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

' Domains as frames
frame "VASFulfillment" as VASFulfillment
frame "VASScheduler" as VASScheduler
frame "VasApplication" as VasApplication
frame "VasLifecycle" as VasLifecycle

' Actors
boundary "CRON" as CRON
boundary "FulfillmentTimer" as FulfillmentTimer
boundary "VasLifecycleTimer" as VasLifecycleTimer

' Domain queues
queue "VASFulfillment events" as VASFulfillment_events
queue "VASScheduler events" as VASScheduler_events
queue "VasApplication events" as VasApplication_events

' Workflow flows
CRON --> VASScheduler : 1. advances schedule
VASScheduler -> VASScheduler : 2. selects VAS deliveries that are due from snapshot
VASScheduler ->> VASScheduler_events : 3. VASReadyForFulfillment
VASFulfillment -> VASFulfillment : 4. validates snapshot parameters are present
VASFulfillment ->> VASFulfillment_events : 5. RequestVasApplication
VASFulfillment_events --> VasApplication : 6. RequestVasApplication
VasApplication -> VasApplication : 7. delegates apply through provider translator
VasApplication ->> VasApplication_events : 8. VasApplicationAcknowledged
VasApplication_events --> VASFulfillment : 9. VasApplicationAcknowledged
VASFulfillment -> VASFulfillment : 10. records correlation for vasFulfillmentId
VasApplication ->> VasApplication_events : 11. VasApplied
VasApplication_events --> VASFulfillment : 12. VasApplied
VASFulfillment -> VASFulfillment : 13. advances internal VAS lifecycle for succeeded delivery
VASFulfillment ->> VasLifecycle : 14. to record fulfillment outcome on VAS aggregate
VASFulfillment ->> VASFulfillment_events : 15. VasFulfilled
VASFulfillment_events --> VasApplication : 16. RequestVasApplication
VasApplication -> VasApplication : 17. delegates apply through provider translator
VasApplication ->> VasApplication_events : 18. VasApplicationFailed
VasApplication_events --> VASFulfillment : 19. VasApplicationFailed
VASFulfillment -> VASFulfillment : 20. classifies failure and exhausts retry policy when applicable
VASFulfillment ->> VasLifecycle : 21. to record terminal failure for the VAS attempt
VASFulfillment ->> VASFulfillment_events : 22. VasFulfillmentFailed
FulfillmentTimer --> VASFulfillment : 23. fires fulfillment deadline sweep
VASFulfillment -> VASFulfillment : 24. finds pending correlations past deadline
VASFulfillment ->> VasLifecycle : 25. to record timeout outcome for the VAS attempt
VASFulfillment ->> VASFulfillment_events : 26. VasFulfillmentTimedOut
VASFulfillment ->> VASFulfillment_events : 27. RequestEndOfVasApplication
VasLifecycleTimer --> VASFulfillment : 28. fires configured end_time for active time_based VAS
VASFulfillment ->> VASFulfillment_events : 29. RequestEndOfVasApplication
VASFulfillment_events --> VasApplication : 30. RequestEndOfVasApplication
VasApplication -> VasApplication : 31. delegates finish through provider translator
VasApplication ->> VasApplication_events : 32. VasApplicationEnded
VasApplication_events --> VasLifecycle : 33. VasApplicationEnded
VasLifecycle -> VasLifecycle : 34. records time-based VAS as ended

@enduml